{"id": "p005-036", "text": "Visited Abigail Wright in the Whittington - came off her bike Sunday, broken collarbone + 3 ribs. op to pin the collarbone Friday morning. her partner Nikolai is staying over every night, looks exhausted. she's a big Strictly fan so maybe load some episodes onto the old iPad and drop it in Thursday evening. text him after the op", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail Wright", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "came off her bike", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broken collarbone + 3 ribs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op to pin the collarbone", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Strictly", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "load some episodes onto the old iPad and drop it in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the op", "anchor": "a2"}]}
